ata set.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">Value</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">Frequency</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$15$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td></tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$17$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td></tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$18$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$20$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nWhat is the minimum value of the data set?\n\nThe minimum data value is\n{{field-1}}."] [:db/cas 17592186229334 :question/problem "A quality control inspector recorded the number of defective batteries produced during $10$ different shifts. The data are displayed in the table below.\n\n| Shift | Number of defective batteries |\n| --- | ---: |\n| A | $12$ |\n| B | $15$ |\n| C | $13$ |\n| D | $11$ |\n| E | $14$ |\n| F | $15$ |\n| G | $16$ |\n| H | $13$ |\n| I | $12$ |\n| J | $14$ |\n\nWhat is the range of the number of defective batteries produced across all $10$ shifts?" "A quality control inspector recorded the number of defective batteries produced during $10$ different shifts. The data are displayed in the table below.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">Shift</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">Number of defective batteries</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">A</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td></tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">B</td><td data-cell-al