>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$300$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nHow many of the voters under $40$ surveyed responded that they do not support the bond measure?"] [:db/cas 17592186229524 :question/problem "A city polled $1, 180$ residents about whether they support a new park initiative. The table below summarizes all $1, 180$ responses.\n\n|  | Homeowners | Renters |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Support | $390$ | $280$ |\n| Do Not Support | ? | $220$ |\n\nHow many of the homeowners surveyed responded that they do not support the park initiative?" "A city polled $1, 180$ residents about whether they support a new park initiative. The table below summarizes all $1, 180$ responses.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-border-top=\"solid\" data-border-left=\"solid\"></td>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Homeowners</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Renters</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"left\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Support</th>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$390$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$280$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th data-cell-align=\"left\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Do Not Support</th>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">?</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$220$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nHow many of the homeowners surveyed responded that they do not support the park initiative?"] [:db/cas 17592186229545 :question/problem "| Value | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $10 - 12$ | $4$ |\n| $12 - 14$ | $2$ |\n| $14 - 16$ | $5$ |\n| $16 - 18$ | $3$ |\n| $18 - 20$ | $2$ |\n\nThe frequency table above shows the number of values in a dataset that fall into each group. What is the smallest possible value of the median?" "\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-ali